            "sid": "NUM 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kirwor Ekapolon neni a Moses ka Aron tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Emaikina Ŋisirael todukokis ŋiemae kec, ŋinituŋanan kaapei ka ŋituŋa a ekabila keŋ diyete abendera a ekal keŋ. Emaikina ikes todukokis ŋiemae kec iteorito ŋikekya loeema ŋolokilipet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina ŋituŋa a Yuda toloma lowae ŋolo alo Kide, lowae ŋolo elomununia akoloŋ, Nason lokoku ka Aminadab iŋes erae ekarikon a ŋituŋa a ekabila a Yuda ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae ekimar a ŋikilyok a ŋulu epedorito ejie a ŋulu aponi kigirae ŋalipyo ŋatomonikanikaarei ka ŋaomwon ka ŋamiae ŋakanikapei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diyete ekabila a Yuda emaikina toloma ŋituŋa a ekabila a Isakar, ekarikon kec iŋes Nasaniel lokoku a Suar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae ekimar a ŋikilyok a ŋulu apedorito ejie, a ŋulu aponi kigirae ŋalipyo ŋatomonikan ka ŋaomwon ka ŋamiae ŋaomwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diyete a ekabila a Isakar emaikina toloma ŋituŋa a ekabila a Sebulon; ekarikon kec iŋes Eliab ŋolo arae lokoku a Elon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae ekimar a ŋikilyok a ŋulu apedorito ejie, a ŋulu aponi kigirae ŋalipyo ŋatomonikan ka ŋakanikaarei ka ŋamiae ŋaomwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae ekimar a ŋikilyok analomar a Yuda anatuketa kec kaapei ŋalipyo amiat ka ŋatomonikanikauni ka ŋikanikapei ka ŋamiae ŋaomwon. Ikes emaikina iŋarenete ewuotokinete Ŋisirael anakibois a ŋina sek alomito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
