          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alowae a ŋolo alo Kwap, emaikina toloma ŋituŋa a ekabila a Ruben a ŋatuketa kec. Elisur ŋolo erae lokoku a Sedeur iŋes erae ekarikon a ekabila a Ruben, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "erae ekimar a ŋikilyok a ŋulu apedorete ejie a ŋulu aponi kigirae ŋalipyo ŋatomoniomwon ka ŋakanikapei ka ŋamiae ŋakan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diyete ekabila a Ruben emaikina toloma ŋituŋa a ekabila a Simeon, ekarikon kec iŋes Selumiel lokoku ka Surisadai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "erae ekimar a ŋikilyok a ŋulu apedorito ejie a ŋulu aponi kigirae ŋalipyo ŋatomonikan ka ŋakanikaomwon ka ŋamiae ŋauni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totupak ekabila a Gad; erae ekarikon a ŋituŋa a ekabila a Gad Eliasap ŋolo arae lokoku ka Reuel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "erae ekimar a ŋikilyok a ŋulu apedorito ejie, a ŋulu aponi kigirae ŋalipyo ŋatomoniomwon ka ŋakan ka ŋamiae ŋakanikapei ka ŋatomonikan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae ekimar a ŋikilyok analomar a Ruben ŋalipyo amiat ka ŋatomonikan ka apei ka ŋamiae ŋaomwon ka ŋatomonikan anatuketa kec, ikes emaikina totupakis ŋituŋa alomar a Yuda ewotokinete Ŋisirael anakibois a ŋina sek alomito,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
