          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekimar a ŋikilyok analomar a Epuraim a ŋatuketa kec arae ŋalipyo amiat ka ŋakanikauni ka amiat, ikes emaikina totupakis ŋituŋa alomar a Ruben ewotokinete Ŋisirael anakibois a ŋina sek alomito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.24",
