          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totupak ekabila a Naputali, ekarikon kec iŋes Aira lokoku a Enan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae ekimar a ŋikilyok a ŋulu apedorito ejie a ŋulu aponi kigirae ŋalipyo ŋatomonikan ka ŋauni ka ŋamiae ŋaomwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekimar a ŋikilyok a daadaŋ analomar a Dan a ŋatuketa kec, erae ŋalipyo amiat ka ŋatomonikan ka ŋakanikaarei ka ŋamiae ŋakanikapei. Ikes erotokinete ekaku ŋikabilae ŋuluce daadaŋ apaki ŋina ewotokiniata Ŋisirael anakibois a ŋina sek alomito.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
