              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Ŋisirael kitiyata lopite ŋolo ecikitor Ekapolon Moses, toloma nakiboisyo a ŋalomarisinei, towotonokis a ŋikabilae, ŋinituŋanan erukito ka ŋituŋa ateker keŋ ka ŋulu a ekal a papa keŋ.",
